Third-party components included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------

The menu, selector, viewport and animation code under `components/astrolabe_ui/`
— `smooth_menu`, `menu`, `selector`, `simple_menu`, `lv_anim` and `camera` — is
from the smooth_menu library.

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2023 Forairaaaaa

The full text is kept alongside the sources as
`components/astrolabe_ui/smooth_menu.LICENSE`.

The display definition, pin map and touch driver — `hal_display.hpp`,
`hal_pins.h` and `hal_tp.hpp` — are derived from M5Dial-UserDemo. `hal_tp.hpp`
has been modified: the I2C layer was replaced and instrumentation was added.

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2023 M5Stack
    Authored by Forairaaaaa

Each of these files keeps its original authorship header.

Third-party components fetched at build time
--------------------------------------------

These are not included here. They are downloaded when you build, and their
licences are their own.

  LovyanGFX                     MIT AND BSD-2-Clause
  https://github.com/lovyan03/LovyanGFX

  Material Design Icons         Pictogrammers Free License
  (webfont, pinned to 7.4.47)   https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/
